msgid "Back"
msgstr "返回"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "开始"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "继续"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Easy"
msgstr "简单"

msgid "Hard"
msgstr "困难"

msgid "Next level · Enter"
msgstr "进入下一关 · Enter"

msgid "Level %s · %s · Moves: %d"
msgstr "关卡 %s · %s · 已走 %d 步"

msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

msgid "Controls"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

msgid "Show legal moves"
msgstr "显示可走邻格"

msgid "Show reachable tiles when a particle is selected."
msgstr "选中棋子时，显示可以进入的相邻格。"

msgid "Reduced motion"
msgstr "减少动态效果"

msgid "Freeze the sky and show moves without animation."
msgstr "冻结星轨，并立即显示行动结果。"

msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "全屏显示"

msgid "Press F11 to toggle fullscreen."
msgstr "F11 可以随时切换全屏。"

msgid "Select / move"
msgstr "选中 / 移动"

msgid "Click a particle, then a neighboring tile"
msgstr "点棋子，再点相邻格"

msgid "Move"
msgstr "移动"

msgid "Cycle particles"
msgstr "选择棋子"

msgid "Undo"
msgstr "撤销"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重新开始"

msgid "Deselect / pause"
msgstr "取消选择 / 暂停"

msgid "Meet opposite colors to clear the board. The collision tile disappears.\nMatching colors block each other. Portals with the same letter are linked."
msgstr "让异色棋子相遇，清空棋盘。相遇处的地板会消失。\n同色棋子互相阻挡；相同字母的传送门成对连通。"

msgid "Settings are saved automatically."
msgstr "设置会自动保存。"

msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "设置已保存。"

msgid "Could not save settings. Changes still apply to this session."
msgstr "设置未能写入磁盘，当前会话仍然生效。"

msgid "Clear the board"
msgstr "清空棋盘即可"

msgid "Clear the board in the fewest moves"
msgstr "以最少步数清空棋盘"

msgid "Previous chapter"
msgstr "上一章"

msgid "Next chapter"
msgstr "下一章"

msgid "   ·   Best possible: %d"
msgstr "   ·   最优 %d 步"

msgid "Pause · Esc"
msgstr "暂停 · Esc"

msgid "Undo · Z"
msgstr "撤销 · Z"

msgid "Restart · R"
msgstr "重新开始 · R"

msgid "Try again"
msgstr "再试一次"

msgid "Levels"
msgstr "关卡选择"

msgid "Next level"
msgstr "下一关"

msgid "Moves · Personal best: %s"
msgstr "步数 · 个人最佳：%s"

msgid "Save failed"
msgstr "存档失败"

msgid "Your current game and records are still available in this session."
msgstr "当前会话仍保留对局和记录。"

msgid "Optimal"
msgstr "最优解"

msgid "Complete"
msgstr "完成"

msgid "Try fewer moves"
msgstr "再少几步"

msgid "Moves: %d / %d"
msgstr "%d / %d 步"

msgid "Moves: %d"
msgstr "%d 步"

msgid "Back to levels"
msgstr "返回选关"

msgid "Select a particle"
msgstr "请选择棋子"

msgid "Cannot move"
msgstr "无法移动"

msgid "Unable to load levels."
msgstr "无法加载关卡"

msgid "Paused"
msgstr "暂停"

msgid "Resume"
msgstr "继续游戏"

msgid "Restart level"
msgstr "重新开始本关"

msgid "Home"
msgstr "返回首页"

msgid "First Contact"
msgstr "初见"

msgid "Encounter"
msgstr "相遇"

msgid "Select a particle, then a neighboring tile. Bring black and white together."
msgstr "点选一颗棋子，再点相邻格。让黑与白相遇。"

msgid "Closer"
msgstr "靠近一点"

msgid "Move one tile at a time. Choose which particle takes the next step."
msgstr "每次只走一格。选择哪一颗移动，由你决定。"

msgid "Borrowed Space"
msgstr "借来的空位"

msgid "A small empty pocket changes who can pass."
msgstr "一个小小的空位，决定谁能先通过。"

msgid "Last Crossing"
msgstr "最后的渡口"

msgid "Choices"
msgstr "取舍"

msgid "Choose where to meet while both shores still need the crossing."
msgstr "两岸都还需要渡口时，想好在哪里相遇。"

msgid "Counterflow"
msgstr "逆向流"

msgid "Three pairs share one loop. Make room before closing a route."
msgstr "三对黑白共用一圈通路。封路前，先留出错身的空间。"

msgid "Step Back"
msgstr "退一步"

msgid "The nearest meeting may be too soon."
msgstr "最近的相遇，也许来得太早。"

msgid "Fold"
msgstr "折叠"

msgid "Beyond"
msgstr "另一端"

msgid "The two A tiles are linked. A portal move costs one step."
msgstr "带 A 的两个格子相连。走入传送门，只计一步。"

msgid "Occupied Orbit"
msgstr "占位轨道"

msgid "The particle at the far end has a journey of its own."
msgstr "另一端的棋子，也有自己的路要走。"

msgid "Afterimage"
msgstr "残影"

msgid "A vanished portal can leave a path behind."
msgstr "一扇门消失后，也可能留下通路。"

msgid "Relay"
msgstr "接力"

msgid "One journey opens the way for the next."
msgstr "一段旅程，为下一段让出道路。"

msgid "Exchange"
msgstr "交换"

msgid "Stillness"
msgstr "归于灰"

msgid "Four arms share one center. Let each particle find its place."
msgstr "四条支路共用一个中心，让每颗棋子找到自己的位置。"

msgid "Event Horizon"
msgstr "视界"

msgid "Traffic can travel in both directions. Keep room for the return."
msgstr "路不只通向远方，也要为归来的棋子留出位置。"

msgid "Two Paths"
msgstr "两段路"

msgid "Remnants"
msgstr "留与失"

msgid "Choose which stretch of path to preserve, then decide who moves closer."
msgstr "先决定留下哪一段路，再决定谁向谁靠近。"

msgid "Three Encounters"
msgstr "三次相遇"

msgid "Three pairs share a narrow passage. Keep a route open for the last pair."
msgstr "三对黑白，共用一处窄口。别让最后一对无路可走。"

msgid "Make Room"
msgstr "借一步"

msgid "When matching colors block the way, make room for one another."
msgstr "同色挡在前面时，不妨先为彼此借出一个位置。"

msgid "Across the Bridge"
msgstr "桥两端"

msgid "Not every tile is a good place to say goodbye."
msgstr "不是每一块地板都适合用来告别。"

msgid "Clear the Passage"
msgstr "先过门"

msgid "Recurrence"
msgstr "往复"

msgid "A particle is waiting at the far end. Clear the exit before the next portal move."
msgstr "另一端还有棋子在等。先疏通出口，再安排下一次传送。"

msgid "One Gate Left"
msgstr "留一扇门"

msgid "Remove one portal, then cross the normal tile left at its partner."
msgstr "让一扇门消失，再走过另一扇门留下的地板。"

msgid "Crossed Signals"
msgstr "双向来信"

msgid "Two portal pairs connect separate paths. Bring the right colors together."
msgstr "两组传送门连接不同的路。让相遇发生在对的地方。"

msgid "Clear the Exit"
msgstr "让出出口"

msgid "Sometimes the particle at the destination must move before a journey can begin."
msgstr "有时需要先移动目的地的棋子，旅程才真正开始。"

msgid "move"
msgid_plural "moves"
msgstr[0] "步"
